{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Map the Datadog API key to the OTLP header**\n\nThe runner does not consume `DATADOG_API_KEY` for exporting; it only deploys headers supplied through `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS`. Following these instructions sends traces to Datadog without `dd-api-key`, so ingestion fails. Document the required header mapping and CLI selections.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx87svPeh","finding_digest":"87184d8dfe95c04e3b66f6775c3f1679ea9bb0c3681120e9e63d5146e8683763","finding_id":"arf_v1_q4me3dp6sxae4o3g6z3vypywph","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/readme::datadog-manual-run::missing-exporter-auth-header","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/readme::datadog-manual-run::missing-exporter-auth-header","line":191,"observation_digest":"afc83ceaf2455262d5edcc9e498b48659e08b880fda9992d5f5842d57cc93bbe","observation_id":"aro_v1_v7edz2xsivjgfvpnzspetc2imw","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/README.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:37:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ld2f4r7x5mym3qcoyscxea2ffj","reviewed_base_sha":"df872a9dbfc4719d2d5b8ad86605b86c4e7c0a56","reviewed_head_sha":"95e76f77cb58feea709e5c724ba690625e7f83b3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":188,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_mqocowpqaxzi3623sfa2zalgqe"},"pull_request":{"number":117},"record_id":"art_v1_lzf76tpluxilkwosv326qzvjty","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:37:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
